From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:12:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebrand: new Universal Converter logo, favicons, manifest,
 theme-aware header/footer

- New SVG logo set (light/dark/icon) and favicon/app-icon/og-image PNGs
- Header rendered by app.js uses theme-aware <picture> logos (symbol-only <=380px)
- Footer logo applied via shared stylesheet for all generated pages
- Versioned (?v=2) URLs because images are cached 1y immutable
- Runtime icon links for pages without them; SW precache + manifest updated
- Remove 'The' from brand name in prose
